+/// Preserve the scalar fmadds boundaries shared by the retail fighter,
+/// item and environmental knockback paths (80079B48..8007A040 and the
+/// inlined copies in 8007A06C). The original compiler contracts three
+/// multiply/add pairs and multiplies weight_term * inner before x11C.
